flowchart TD
  Version[Knowledge Document Version: pending] --> Intent[Versioned ingestion job]
  Intent --> Queue[Redis / BullMQ queue]
  Queue --> Worker[Document Processing Worker]
  Worker --> Claim[Knowledge internal claim and revalidation]
  Claim --> Download[Short-lived pinned object download]
  Download --> Extract[Extract PDF DOCX TXT Markdown]
  Extract --> Normalize[Normalize v1]
  Normalize --> Chunk[Deterministic chunking v1]
  Chunk --> Embed[Embedding provider adapter]
  Embed --> Publish[Knowledge internal batch publication]
  Publish --> Store[(Knowledge PostgreSQL + pgvector)]
  Store --> Ready[Document Version: ready]
  Ready -. "Phase 7 only" .-> Retrieval[Secure retrieval]
